OL,3,GNEWSAIsland falls silent for
OL,4,ARemembrance commemorations
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across the Isle of Man have
OL,7,Fgathered to pay their respects for
OL,8,FArmistice Day.
OL,10,FCommemorations took place in villages
OL,11,Fand towns, many marking the two-minute
OL,12,Fsilence with a gathering at the local
OL,13,Fwar memorial.
OL,15,FIn the capital, Douglas, Lieutenant
OL,16,FGovernor Sir John Lorimer led the
OL,17,Fwreath laying on Harris Promenade,
OL,18,Fwhere 80-year-old David Lace was among
OL,19,Fthe crowd.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
