OL,3,GNEWSAIsland falls silent for
OL,4,ARemembrance commemorations
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaying a wooden cross at the monument
OL,7,Fto remember his grandfather, father and
OL,8,Funcles, he said: "I feel like it should
OL,9,Fnever be forgotten. It must have been
OL,10,Fabsolutely terrible for them, in those
OL,11,Fyears."
